    "description": "<p>Spend any number of Hope to call or<br>secure that many simple vehicles,<br>bikes, beasts, cyber-mounts, drones, or<br>survival transports that you and your<br>allies can drive until your next long rest<br>or the vehicles take any damage.<br>The vehicles double your land speed<br>while traveling and, when in danger,<br>allow you to move within Far range<br>without having to roll.<br>Creatures driving a vehicles gain a -2<br>penalty to attack rolls and a +2 bonus<br>to damage rolls.</p>",
